graph LR
    User[User]
    Browser[Browser / Web UI]
    Electron[Electron Desktop]
    CLI[OpenAlice CLI / SSH]

    Guardian[Guardian<br/>supervision + single-writer control]
    Alice[Alice backend<br/>workspace + product APIs]
    Web[Web UI transport<br/>HTTP / Vite / Electron IPC]
    Workspace[Workspace Service]
    PTY[Workspace PTYs]
    Agents[Native agent CLIs<br/>claude / codex / omp / pi / shell]
    Tools[ToolCenter + domain tools<br/>market / analysis / news / Inbox]
    State[File-backed OPENALICE_HOME<br/>config / sessions / issues / schedules]

    UTA[UTA trading authority]
    Contracts[Shared contracts<br/>uta-protocol / guardian-runtime]
    Broker[Broker connections<br/>IBKR / Broker Packs]
    Connector[Optional Connector Service]
    Market[Market data + RSS providers]
    Notify[Discord / Telegram Inbox targets]

    User --> Browser
    User --> Electron
    User --> CLI
    Browser --> Web
    Electron --> Web
    Electron --> Guardian
    CLI --> Guardian
    Guardian --> Alice
    Guardian --> UTA
    Guardian -. optional .-> Connector

    Alice --> Web
    Alice --> Workspace
    Alice --> Tools
    Alice --> State
    Web --> Workspace
    Workspace --> PTY
    PTY --> Agents
    Tools --> Market
    Tools --> Connector
    Connector --> Notify

    Alice <-->|UTA client HTTP| UTA
    Alice --> Contracts
    UTA --> Contracts
    UTA --> Broker

